      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Label above, 40px control, reserved message line below.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><label class=\"ds-label\" for=\"ds-reg\">Registration number</label><input class=\"ds-input\" id=\"ds-reg\" placeholder=\"12345678\"><p class=\"ds-msg\">Only you and the coordinator see this.</p></div>",
